WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.002
Do you want to go to the cinema on Saturday?

00:00:03.252 --> 00:00:06.487
Yes, but I work until six.

00:00:06.737 --> 00:00:09.474
We can go after dinner.

00:00:09.724 --> 00:00:13.227
Good idea. Shall we meet at eight?

00:00:13.477 --> 00:00:15.618
Yes, in front of the cinema.
